  {0x749BB364U, "It lures prey close with hypnotic motions, then wraps its tentacles around it before finishing it off with digestive fluids. It forces others to do whatever it wants.", "ATRAI PRESAS COM MOVIMENTOS HIPNOTICOS, DEPOIS ENVOLVE SEUS TENTACULOS ANTES DE TERMINAR COM FLUIDOS DIGESTIVOS."},
  {0x749BD672U, "Despite their elegant appearance, they can flap their wings strongly and fly for thousands of miles. The one in the middle is the leader of the flock.", "APESAR DE SUA APARENCIA ELEGANTE, ELES PODEM BATER AS ASAS FORTEMENTE E VOAR POR MILHARES DE QUILOMETROS."},
