  {0xFD36C82DU, "Its health ebbs and flows with the lunar cycle. It brims with power when exposed to the light of the full moon.", "SUA SAUDE FLUI COM O CICLO LUNAR E TRANSBORDA ENERGIA QUANDO EXPOSTA A LUZ DA LUA CHEIA."},
  {0xFD43EA50U, "The leaves on its forelegs are as sharp as swords. It agilely leaps about the branches of trees to strike.", "AS FOLHAS EM SUAS PATAS DIANTEIRAS SAO TAO AFIADAS QUANTO ESPADAS."},
  {0xFD472CD6U, "It is entirely composed of rocks with no sign of a brain or heart. It is a mystery even to modern scientists.", "E INTEIRAMENTE COMPOSTO DE ROCHAS SEM SINAL DE CEREBRO OU CORACAO, E UM MISTERIO ATE PARA OS CIENTISTAS MODERNOS."},
