  {0xFDB1059CU, "A POKEMON with abundant curiosity. It shows an interest in everything, so it always zigs and zags.", "UM POKEMON COM MUITA CURIOSIDADE, MOSTRA INTERESSE EM TUDO, ENTAO SEMPRE ZIGS E ZAGS."},
  {0xFDBC6575U, "It is always hungry because it won't stop rampaging. Even while it is eating, it can't keep still.", "ESTA SEMPRE COM FOME PORQUE NAO VAI PARAR DE FICAR FURIOSO, MESMO ENQUANTO ESTA COMENDO, NAO PODE FICAR PARADO."},
